Thank you for your request to travel with a child car seat.<br />
<br />
Your request has been approved for your upcoming Qantas booking &lt;<strong>INSERT PNR</strong>&gt;.<br />
<br />
All car seats must be in good condition, show no signs of damage, and be fitted to the aircraft seat by the responsible adult traveling with the child. Please refer to the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/children/child-restraints.html">Child car seat and restraint systems</a>&nbsp;link for more information.<br />
<br />
This email serves to provide pre-approval; however, final approval will be given by the airport upon sighting the car seat.<br />
<br />
Seat allocation for car seats and child restraint systems is restricted and availability may vary by aircraft type.<br />
